2026</span></span></p><h1 class="post__title" data-v-e174a07f>Important EU customs update for ecommerce shipments from July 2026</h1></header><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServicesc972.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C6015%2C4016&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C6015%2C4016&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C6015%2C4016&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above." width="960" height="641" class="post__featured-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e174a07f><section class="post__content" data-v-e174a07f><div data-v-e174a07f><!--[--><section id="we-want-to-make-you-aware-of-important-updates-to-eu-customs-regulation-that-will-affect-low-value-ecommerce-shipments-entering-the-eu-from-1-july-2026." class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="0" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We want to make you aware of important updates to EU customs regulation that will affect low value ecommerce shipments entering the EU from 1 July 2026.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><h2><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Changes to EU import requirements<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h2><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Several new customs measures will come into effect from <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->1 July 2026. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->These changes are designed to update the way low value goods are processed when entering the EU for B2C (Business to Consumer) shippers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><h3><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->New €3 customs duty per declared item<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h3><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->From <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->1 July 2026, <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->a fixed customs duty of <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->€3 per item or tariff line declaration<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> will apply to eligible shipments.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->This charge:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Applies to goods with a value of <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->€150 or less<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Is charged per item or tariff line, rather than per parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Applies to both <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->IOSS <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->and <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->non-IOSS<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> shipments<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Is payable in addition to any applicable import VAT<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section id="personal-sender?" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--white" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="darkBannerLeftImageButton" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_72012423.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C824%2C5573%2C3706&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C824%2C5573%2C3706&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6tjlJbqstJ9-fAS_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7201.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C824%2C5573%2C3706&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A family of four pose smiling in front of their front door holding two parcels. The family consists of a father, mother and two daughters." width="1000" height="665" class="landing-feature-banner__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--white landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Personal Sender?</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--white landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The new €3 customs duty applies to goods sold by businesses to customers in the EU. If you are sending a gift to a family member or friend with a total value less than €45 there will be no additional duty to pay.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-2 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--white" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/international-send" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Send a gift today<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="understanding-the-charges" class="section-wrapper information-table__section" index="2" data-v-1dc8ab9e data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><h2 data-v-1dc8ab9e>Understanding the charges</h2><!----><div class="reusable-table__wrapper" data-v-1dc8ab9e data-v-0e99fcf9><table class="reusable-table__table reusable-table__table--header-row-blue" data-v-0e99fcf9><thead class="reusable-table__titles" data-v-0e99fcf9><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><th data-v-0e99fcf9>#</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Shipment Contents</th><th data-v-0e99fcf9>Duty Paid</th><!--]--></tr></thead><tbody class="reusable-table__data" data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Example 1</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>1 Item (1 HS Code)</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>€3 customs duty</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Example 2</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>3 Items (3 HS Codes)</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>€9 customs duty</td><!--]--></tr><tr data-v-0e99fcf9><!--[--><td data-v-0e99fcf9>Example 3</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>3 of the same item (1 HS Code)</td><td data-v-0e99fcf9>€3 customs duty</td><!--]--></tr><!--]--></tbody></table></div><p class="information-table__footer-text" data-v-1dc8ab9e><small data-v-1dc8ab9e>Please note that multiple tariff line declarations may be required where products have different HS codes, product descriptions, or, from 1 November 2026, different countries of origin.</small></p><div class="information-table__footer-button-wrap" data-v-1dc8ab9e><!----></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="end-of-the-€150-customs-duty-exemption" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="3" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->End of the €150 customs duty exemption<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h3><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The current customs duty exemption for lower value goods will be removed.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Up to 30 June 2026 – <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Goods valued at €150 or less are generally exempt from customs duty<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->From 1 July 2026 – <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Customs duty will apply to all imports, regardless of shipment value<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><h3><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Import One Stop Shop (IOSS)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h3><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The Import One Stop Shop (IOSS) scheme will remain in place for the collection of VAT at the point of sale.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->However:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Customs duties will not be collected through IOSS<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Any applicable customs duties will need to be managed separately <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       The €3 customs duty charge is non-refundable<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section id="two-female-business-owners-in-a-stock-room-seen-handling-parcels-and-smiling" class="photo-container" index="4" data-v-b709af2f><picture data-v-b709af2f><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aADSo-vxEdbNPLel_Smallbusinesspackingboxes-1--1-1c51.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aADSo-vxEdbNPLel_Smallbusinesspackingboxes-1--1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C241%2C1000%2C233&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aADSo-vxEdbNPLel_Smallbusinesspackingboxes-1--1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C241%2C1000%2C233&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aADSo-vxEdbNPLel_Smallbusinesspackingboxes-1--1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C241%2C1000%2C233&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Two female business owners in a stock room seen handling parcels and smiling" width="1200" height="280" class="photo-block" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-b709af2f></picture></section><section id="coming-soon:-further-changes-expected-from-november-2026" class="section-wrapper rich-text" index="5" data-v-92714c58 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Coming Soon: Further changes expected from November 2026<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h2><h3><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Proposed EU customs handling fee<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h3><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The EU is also considering the introduction of a <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->€2 customs handling fee per parcel<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, which is currently expected to take effect from <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->November 2026.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If introduced, this fee would be charged in addition to:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       The €3 customs duty per item or tariff line declaration<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Any other applicable import taxes and charges<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><h3><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Expanded data requirements<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h3><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->From 1 November 2026, additional product level information is expected to be required for distance selling customs declarations. This is expected to include:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Standardised manufacturer product identifiers, where available<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Non standardised manufacturer product identifiers (<!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->mandatory<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->·       Merchant product identifiers (<!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->mandatory<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Further guidance is expected from EU authorities, and Evri will provide updates as more information becomes available. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><h2><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->What you should do now<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></h2><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->To help ensure a smooth transition, we recommend reviewing your product data, systems and integrations ahead of these changes. Being prepared can help minimise disruption and support compliance with the new EU customs requirements. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--><!--]--></div></section><section id="frequently-asked-questions" class="faqs" index="6" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howcanifindoutmoreinformation-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howcanifindoutmoreinformation" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howcanifindoutmoreinformation" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How can I find out more information?-open answer" data-test-id="howcanifindoutmoreinformation-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howcanifindoutmoreinformation-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How can I find out more information?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howcanifindoutmoreinformation" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howcanifindoutmoreinformation" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howcanifindoutmoreinformation-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Further information about the upcoming changes can be found on the <!--]--><!--]--><a href="https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/news/guidance-and-legal-text-temporary-flat-fee-low-value-imports-which-will-apply-until-1-july-2028-2026-06-08_en" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Taxation and Customs Union website<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whatremainsunchanged-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatremainsunchanged" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatremainsunchanged" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What remains unchanged?-open answer" data-test-id="whatremainsunchanged-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatremainsunchanged-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What remains unchanged?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 